    <string name="sensitivity_custom">Custom</string>
    <string name="info_sensitivity_body">How sharp the jerk of the arm wearing the watch needs to be to count as a shot. A higher number (like 20) needs a sharper movement and ignores light swings; a lower number (like 8) catches gentler releases but can misfire from random arm movement.</string>

    <string name="cooldown_title">Shot cooldown</string>
    <string name="info_cooldown_body">The minimum time after a counted shot before the next one can register. Stops a single release\'s follow-through vibration from being counted as two shots.</string>

